  era: "1782\u20131799 \xB7 Section 17 \xB7 Regional Powers \xB7 18th century"
  title: Tipu Sultan
  text: Tipu Sultan, Haidar's son, ruled from 1782 to 1799. He used iron-cased rockets in war, introduced new coins, a new calendar and trade policies, and sought French help. He died defending Srirangapatna in the Fourth Anglo-Mysore War.
